        limit the length of time the alarm sounds when turned on. Each time "true" is written to the On/Off resource,
        the alarm will sound again for the configured duration. If no duration is programmed or the setting is
        "false", writing a "true" to the On/Off resource will result in the alarm sounding continuously until a
        "false" is written to the On/Off resource.
