            Bit mask to inform about the type of measurements that are taken into account in the calculation of wet bulb
            globe temperature : 0 = Ambient Temperature, 1 = Black Globe Temperature, 2 = Humidity, 3 = Air Pressure, 4 =
            Illuminance, 5 = Wind speed, 6 = Visible radiation, 7 = Infrared radiation. If the sensor considers both
            ambien temperature, air pressure and illuminance, the value of this resource shall be: 0001101.
            */
            [ResourceId(1), Operations("R")] long? Estimation_type;

